# Raw third-party downloads and the sampled files derived from them. Both regenerate
# byte-identically from `prepare.py`, which pins each source to an immutable commit and
# verifies its SHA-256, so committing ~22 MB of someone else's corpus buys nothing.
# `data/MANIFEST.json` is kept: it is the record of exactly which bytes were used.
cache/
data/*.jsonl
!data/MANIFEST.json
